OL,3,GNEWSADiscovery of suspicious package
OL,4,Asparks security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are dealing with a security
OL,7,Falert at Ebrington Square in
OL,8,FLondonderry's Waterside.
OL,10,FIt follows the discovery of a
OL,11,Fsuspicious package at about 15:20 GMT
OL,12,Fon Tuesday, police said.
OL,14,FNo roads are closed but police have
OL,15,Fsaid a nearby business premises has
OL,16,Fbeen evacuated.
OL,18,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,19,Fsaid an update would be provided in due
OL,20,Fcourse.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
